message: "If you use or discuss this working paper, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "System Semantic Kernel (SSK): Operational Logic, Situated Meaning, and Evolution Across Agentic Systems"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Guiducci
    given-names: Graziano
version: "0.4"
date-released: 2026-09-16
repository-code: "https://github.com/GrazianoGuiducci/maios-ssk-paper"
url: "https://github.com/GrazianoGuiducci/maios-ssk-paper"
abstract: >-
  A conceptual account of the coupled event, autological competence generation,
  functional self, operator participation, receiver-relative incarnation,
  multimodal perception and inference, proactive semantic positioning, and
  meaningful continuity in agentic and embodied systems. The semantic identity
  of the Kernel is distinguished from the media and operational mechanisms
  through which a receiving system incarnates it.
keywords:
  - system semantic kernel
  - agentic AI
  - situated competence
  - situated incarnation
  - multimodal systems
  - embodied AI
  - contextual reentry
  - causal readback
  - competence evolution
  - autological generation
  - operator participation
